OL,3,GNEWSASurrey County Council over the
OL,4,Alast 138 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exhibition depicting Surrey County
OL,7,FCouncil (SCC) through the years will
OL,8,Ftour from next month as the local
OL,9,Fauthority winds down after 138 years.
OL,11,FThis exhibition, which will launch at
OL,12,FGuildford library on 3 December, is
OL,13,Fpart of a council campaign ahead of
OL,14,Flocal government reorganisation in
OL,15,FSurrey next April.
OL,17,FPhotographs, documents and stories from
OL,18,Fthe archives will be shared in the
OL,19,Fcollaboration with Surrey History
OL,20,FCentre which runs until March.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
