OL,3,GNEWSASurrey County Council over the
OL,4,Alast 138 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Oliver, SCC leader, said the local
OL,7,Fauthority has a "record to be proud of"
OL,8,Fsince being established in 1889.
